      {
        "author_name": "Nic C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111763259335208931927/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCzBlKWZE9TNC_4IBlcslxvjIgzoDrVf23chKmesWoUC6n5RDc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Dropped by to get some Christmas gifts. Good stock, staff was nice.",
        "time": 1765290153,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joe Putz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106007381758245624610/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJh8K-72W3-iv9enkuT1v5Hu77BYQR7Yr178uxuND6WVjV9UJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "If your in for mens safety boots now is a good time. The choice has a big range in styles lately.  Also they're regular priced but still mostly in the $80 to $130 range.\nThe store is fairly well organized but it's almost impossible to find help, especially after 5pm.  It can be nice to shop without being bothered by salespeople though.",
        "time": 1675912495,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nadia Gagnon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104656094692844505597/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU4JZaEBvJxXBZLAN5vBy19w3Wr_rz8oyXaC4hFMODK1hrL8jIf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Visited this location looking for a gift. It is clean, well organized and the staff is friendly and helpful. I'm always impressed with the variety and quality offered at L'Equipeur.",
        "time": 1732369163,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "L L",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109665704718480893586/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcMyrTjh_PblsH-4TfMsrXZ49BP2Lyh0fiFop8vAHxQvAG6Js=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Great service today from Jaime.He is very patient even when this lady at the cash was swearing at him .",
        "time": 1751504751,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Smarty Pants",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105003237743044660090/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJS54QGznkgCKZR-2EZrFrCtlNkHLETJOuYfsnJ8njSPtOXfA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Generally I’m a fan of L’Équipeur, but this one in particular must be run by the same management as the adjacent Canadian Vaudreuil, tell tale signs are the lack of customer attention, the dumpster fire that is the insole section, boots on display do not match the labels just below them and the fact that no only was there no one at the cash, (but the person who was supposed to be there saw me waiting multiple times and only came once they were done washing the floor). I don’t blame the individual(s) however, I blame management for not keeping their employees trained and motivated but also not properly managing their stock and displays.\n\nYou get two stars only because the L’Équipeur chain in general is quite good.\n\nSuch as the case with Canadian Tire Vaudreuil, I’ll be sure to go to the next closest L’Équipeur next time I need something, despite the fact that I live almost next door.",
        "time": 1706624715,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
